 183:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****       not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 184:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****       are set to the corresponding weak functions.
